@startuml
' Daily report interview algorithm (v19)

title Daily Report Hearing Sequence (5min / v19)

actor User as U
participant "Dialogue LLM" as L
participant "Slot Manager\n(MVS)" as S
participant "Report Formatter" as F

note over L
Timebox: ~5 minutes
Required MVS slots (4): subject, impact, next+deadline, blocker
Priority: subject -> next+deadline -> blocker -> impact
end note

L -> U: Kickoff: "今日はやったことを短く教えてください"
U --> L: Initial answer (normal / short / ambiguous)
L -> S: classify input type

alt Ambiguous (e.g. "いろいろやった")
  L -> U: 2-stage choice\n1) activity domain (4 choices)\n2) outcome type (4 choices)
  U --> L: selected choices
  L -> U: minimal concrete input\n"対象/変化" (10-20 chars)
  U --> L: concrete snippet
  L -> S: set subject + impact (if available)
  alt next or blocker missing
    L -> U: bundled follow-up\n"明日の予定や現状の詰まりはありますか？"
    U --> L: next/blocker info
    L -> S: update next + blocker
  end
else Short (e.g. "進んだ" / "普通")
  L -> U: Q1 current task first\n"何のタスクが進んだ？(単語でOK)"
  U --> L: subject task
  L -> S: set subject
  L -> U: Q2 next+deadline (2 choices)
  U --> L: next selected
  L -> S: set next
  L -> U: Q3 blocker? (yes/no)
  U --> L: blocker status
  L -> S: set blocker
  L -> U: Q4 evidence? (can say / unclear)
  U --> L: evidence status
  alt evidence unclear
    L -> U: evidence type (code/docs/comms/decision)
    U --> L: evidence type
  end
else Normal
  L -> U: ask task + progress
  U --> L: task/progress
  L -> S: set subject + impact(if available)
  alt next or blocker missing
    L -> U: bundled follow-up\n"明日の予定や現状の詰まりはありますか？"
    U --> L: next/blocker info
    L -> S: update next + blocker
  end
end

L -> S: fill required slots\n(subject, impact, next, blocker)

alt impact missing or weak
  L -> U: D48 impact recovery\n"価値があったのは? 準備/リスク低減/判断/共有/なし"
  U --> L: selected value
  alt still none
    L -> U: D53 retry once
    U --> L: retry result
  end
  L -> S: update impact
end

loop until required slots 4/4 OR timeout(C)
  L -> S: gate check\n(required slots complete?)
  alt required slots not done
    L -> U: targeted補完質問 (missing slot priority)
    U --> L: 補完回答
    L -> S: update missing slot
  else required slots done
    break
  end
end

alt required slots done
  L -> U: optional done detail 1 item (if time > 60s)
  U --> L: done detail
  L -> S: set done detail
else timeout reached with missing slots
  L -> S: mark partial mode\n(missing slots noted for summary)
end

note over L,S
Early-close condition definition:
A = required slots complete (subject, impact, next+deadline, blocker)
B = done detail extracted OR no-additional-detail confirmed
C = timeout guard (>=5 min OR remaining < 60s)
Close when (A and B) or (A and C)
Escape route: if C=true and A=false, allow partial report generation with explicit missing-slot notes.
end note

L -> S: early-close check
L -> F: build adaptive daily report format\n(full if A=true / partial if A=false and C=true)
F --> L: report draft
L -> U: summary + final correction (max 1 point)
U --> L: correction or OK
L -> S: finalize

@enduml
